#. +> trunk stable
#: functions/text.xml:19 xml_doc.cpp:4569
msgid "The DOLLAR() function converts a number to text using currency format, with the decimals rounded to the specified place. Although the name is DOLLAR, this function will do the conversion according to the current locale."
msgstr "De Funkschoon DOLLAR() wannelt en Tall in't aktuelle Geldformaat na Text üm un rundt de Nakommasteden as angeven. Ok wenn de Naam \"DOLLAR\" is, warrt de lokaal instellt Geldsort ümwannelt."

