#~ msgid "This is the default format and Tables autodetects the actual data type depending on the current cell data. By default, Tables right justifies numbers, dates and times within a cell and left justifies anything else."
#~ msgstr "Dit is dat Standardformaat. De aktuell Datentyp warrt mit Hülp vun de aktuellen Zelldaten automaatsch rutfunnen. Standardwies warrt Tallen, Datum- un Tietangaven binnen en Zell rechterhand utricht, un all anner Indrääg links."

#~ msgid "This formats your cell content as a time. To enter a time, you should enter it in the Time format set in System Settings -> Common Appearance and Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> Date & Time. In the Cell Format dialog box you can set how the time should be displayed by choosing one of the available time format options. The default format is the system format set in System Settings. When the number in the cell does not make sense as a time, Tables will display 00:00 in the global format you have in System Settings."
#~ msgstr "Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Tiet. En Tiet schall in dat Formaat ingeven warrn, dat in de Systeminstellen bi \"Allgemeen Arbeitrebeet-Utsehn un -Bedregen\" -> \"Spraakinstellen\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un Datum\" fastleggt is.. In't Menü \"Zellenformaat\" lett sik ut verscheden Formaten utsöken, wodennig de Tiet wiest warrt. Dat Standardformaat is dat Systeemformaat, as in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt. Wenn de Tall binnen de Zell sik nich as gellen Tietangaav bruken lett, warrt 00:00 in't globaal Tietformaat wiest."

#~ msgid "This formats your cell content as date and time. To enter a date and a time, you should enter it in the Time format set in System Settings -> Common Appearance and Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> Time & Dates. In the Cell Format dialog box you can set how the time should be displayed by choosing one of the available date format options. The default format is the system format set in System Settings. When the number in the cell does not make sense as a date and time, Tables will display 00:00 in the global format you have in System Settings."
#~ msgstr "Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Datum un Tiet. En Datum un en Tiet schall in't Tietformaat ingeven warrn, dat in't Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Regioon un Toganghülp\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un Datum\" instellt is. In't Menü \"Zellenformaat\" lett sik ut verscheden Formaten utsöken, wodennig dat Datum un de Tiet wiest warrt. Dat Standardformaat is dat Systeemformaat, as in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt. Wenn de Tall binnen de Zell sik nich as gellen Datum- oder Tietangaav bruken lett, warrt 00:00 in't globaal Tietformaat wiest."

